NO, JUST, i- bay di shtub.

221
00:10:41,380 --> 00:10:44,709
LIKE HERE IN THE BACK YARD. geshtelt a khupe, THAT'S ALL.

222
00:10:44,709 --> 00:10:46,317
vu iz geven a shul damolts?

223
00:10:45,936 --> 00:10:48,056
ver hot gegebn khupe kidushn?

224
00:10:47,623 --> 00:10:49,271
iz geven RABBIS.

225
00:10:52,146 --> 00:10:53,796
ven hostu khasene gegat?

226
00:10:53,796 --> 00:10:56,172
velkhe yor? velkhe tsayt? gedenkst?

227
00:10:56,314 --> 00:10:59,041
dos alts iz geven in eyn un fertsik

228
00:10:59,436 --> 00:11:02,602
vayl in tsvey un fertsik hot men likvidirt Byalistoker geto.

229
00:11:03,756 --> 00:11:09,133
SO nokh di khasene, d'host gezogt UNK az ir foter iz geven a fayer WEHR?

230
00:11:08,194 --> 00:11:09,166
ye.

231
00:11:09,173 --> 00:11:11,681
un du bist oykhet gevorn a fayer WEHR?

232
00:11:11,181 --> 00:11:13,723
ye, hot mir gegebn di UNIFORM, der foter

233
00:11:13,813 --> 00:11:17,452
ikh bin geblibn lebn biz tsu di likvidatsye fun Byalistok.

234
00:11:17,222 --> 00:11:19,629
vos hot der fayer WEHR gemakht in di geto?

235
00:11:20,749 --> 00:11:22,388
az s'iz geven fayern

236
00:11:22,388 --> 00:11:24,945
s'iz geven pogromen, UNK m'hot geshosn yidn

237
00:11:24,945 --> 00:11:27,962
hot der fayer mentsh gedorfn opreynikn dos altsding.

238
00:11:28,444 --> 00:11:30,294
hostu oykhet gemuzt dos tun?

239
00:11:29,440 --> 00:11:30,345
ye.

240
00:11:30,402 --> 00:11:33,079
hostu gezen vi nokh zey hobn opgeshosn di yidn?

241
00:11:32,562 --> 00:11:33,484
ye.

242
00:11:35,532 --> 00:11:37,095
vu hostu dos gezen?

243
00:11:37,253 --> 00:11:38,377
in geto.

244
00:11:39,497 --> 00:11:42,039
a spetsyele plats ober

245
00:11:42,501 --> 00:11:43,862
in shtubn?

246
00:11:42,636 --> 00:11:43,350
v-

247
00:11:43,350 --> 00:11:46,984
vu m'hot i- v- vu m'hot im gefunen, do hot men im geshosn.

248
00:11:48,627 --> 00:11:51,971
i- in, in di lagern, in kontsentratsye lager

249
00:11:51,971 --> 00:11:53,561
az eyner iz antlofn

250
00:11:53,807 --> 00:11:54,830
a man

251
00:11:54,870 --> 00:11:57,581
hot er gehat a simen az m'hot im gehat derkent.

252
00:11:57,823 --> 00:11:59,116
vi azoy?

253
00:11:59,157 --> 00:12:01,668
in mitn kop hot men im oysgeshoyrn

254
00:12:01,668 --> 00:12:03,234
tsvey INCHES

255
00:12:03,358 --> 00:12:04,772
oysgeSHAVED

256
00:12:04,772 --> 00:12:07,993
UP TO THE SKIN, hot men im derkent, er iz antlofn fun lager.

257
00:12:08,269 --> 00:12:10,136
a meydl hot men nisht gekent derkenen

258
00:12:10,598 --> 00:12:12,364
iz hot men im glaykh gekhapt.

259
00:12:15,154 --> 00:12:17,038
SO ven zey hobn

260
00:12:17,230 --> 00:12:19,080
likvidirt dos lager

261
00:12:18,968 --> 00:12:20,059
di geto?

262
00:12:19,339 --> 00:12:20,846
I MEAN dos geto

263
00:12:20,503 --> 00:12:21,307
yo

264
00:12:20,846 --> 00:12:24,041
vi nokh hobn zey likvidirt? vos hot pasirt?

265
00:12:24,368 --> 00:12:27,045
m'hot ⟨zikh⟩ opgeshtelt ⟨di⟩ vagonen, a ban

266
00:12:27,203 --> 00:12:30,656
arayngePUSHt undz in farmakhte vagonen

267
00:12:30,713 --> 00:12:32,951
un gefirt biz TREBLINKA.

268
00:12:33,396 --> 00:12:36,765
hobn zey gemakht in di tsaytn selektsyes?

269
00:12:37,581 --> 00:12:38,908
selektsyes?

270
00:12:38,151 --> 00:12:41,118
fun mentshn? ver zol shteyn, ver zol

271
00:12:39,555 --> 00:12:45,101
damolst, alemen, alemen hot men arayngeshtupt in farmakhte vagonen. nisht geven keyn luft, nisht keyn vaser.

272
00:12:45,208 --> 00:12:48,104
ukrayner hot undz gefirt dem transport

273
00:12:49,545 --> 00:12:51,581
ver iz geven mit dir tsuzamen?

274
00:12:52,482 --> 00:12:55,901
ir FAMILY mayn vayb's. ale UNK

275
00:12:56,042 --> 00:12:59,613
nisht bloyz fun Byalistok, fun andere shtet. ver s'iz geven yidn dort.

276
00:13:00,210 --> 00:13:04,119
iz der ban hot zikh opgeshtelt dos ershte in TREBLINKA, un in TREBLINKA hot men d-

277
00:13:04,311 --> 00:13:06,077
tsesheydt.

278
00:13:06,100 --> 00:13:09,674
ver s'iz geven feik oyf arbet un kinder un eltere

279
00:13:09,674 --> 00:13:11,156
in THE GAS CHAMBERS.

280
00:13:11,128 --> 00:13:15,830
far araynkumen in TREBLINKA, ven du bist n- nokh geven in di ban

281
00:13:15,887 --> 00:13:17,568
vi lang hot gedoyert?

282
00:13:17,912 --> 00:13:19,543
vi hot dos oysgezen?

283
00:13:18,199 --> 00:13:20,218
biz m'hot zey aroysgelozn.

284
00:13:20,443 --> 00:13:23,289
vi lang hot gedoyert fun Byalistok nokh TREBLINKA?

285
00:13:23,616 --> 00:13:24,808
tsu forn?

286
00:13:25,843 --> 00:13:26,815
ikh veys

287
00:13:27,227 --> 00:13:29,128
bay zibn akht sho.

288
00:13:30,214 --> 00:13:32,300
vi hot dos oysgezen ineveynik?

289
00:13:32,442 --> 00:13:36,283
iz geven farmakht, hot men nisht gegat keyn luft un nisht keyn esn, gornisht.

290
00:13:37,521 --> 00:13:38,223
nu

291
00:13:38,888 --> 00:13:40,265
azoy vi

292
00:13:40,963 --> 00:13:43,252
TOWARNA vagonen,

293
00:13:43,275 --> 00:13:44,804
vu me firt

294
00:13:44,746 --> 00:13:46,106
di beheymes?

295
00:13:45,418 --> 00:13:46,357
ye.

296
00:13:46,836 --> 00:13:47,842
farmakht.

297
00:13:48,557 --> 00:13:52,854
ven du bist ongekumen in TREBLINKA, hostu gevust vos TREBLINKA iz?

298
00:13:52,928 --> 00:13:54,778
hostu shoyn gevust derfun?

299
00:13:54,868 --> 00:13:55,722
yo.

300
00:13:56,623 --> 00:13:57,984
vos hostu gevust?

301
00:14:01,264 --> 00:14:03,013
ikh veys aleyn nisht vos iz geven.

302
00:14:03,289 --> 00:14:05,375
dos veys ikh az

303
00:14:05,415 --> 00:14:09,999
undz ze'mir geshtanen in di vagonen farmakht, un m'hot gevart biz m'hot zey aruntergelozn

304
00:14:10,275 --> 00:14:11,939
un undz ze'mir geforn vayter.

305
00:14:14,612 --> 00:14:17,576
ven du bist arayn in TREBLINKA, vos hostu gezen?

306
00:14:17,211 --> 00:14:19,888
gornisht. m'iz gezesn in farmakhte vagonen.

307
00:14:19,793 --> 00:14:22,082
SO zey hobn dikh nisht aroysgelozt.

308
00:14:21,160 --> 00:14:22,099
NO.

309
00:14:22,560 --> 00:14:27,009
zey hobn nor oysgelozn di vagonen vos iz gevezn eltere mentshn un kinder.

310
00:14:28,045 --> 00:14:30,772
un undz ze'mir gezesn in di vagonen, farmakht

311
00:14:30,947 --> 00:14:32,696
on luft, on vaser.

312
00:14:32,905 --> 00:14:35,582
vi lang bistu gezits- b- gezesn azoy?

313
00:14:35,773 --> 00:14:37,117
bay tsvey sho

314
00:14:37,663 --> 00:14:40,087
biz zey hobn gehat a ORDER tsu forn vayter.

315
00:14:40,633 --> 00:14:44,981
un dayn vayb un ir familye, iz zi geblibn mit dir tsuzamen?

316
00:14:44,008 --> 00:14:46,314
NO. b- bloyz a

317
00:14:46,506 --> 00:14:49,976
der vayb's a bruder. eyner iz geblibn lebn mit mir.

318
00:14:50,033 --> 00:14:53,385
un di vayb mit di eltern, ale ge- arayngan in TREBLINKA.

319
00:14:53,543 --> 00:14:54,600
hostu ge-

320
00:14:53,678 --> 00:14:55,699
un der bruder irer

321
00:14:55,699 --> 00:14:57,620
a FACT, er iz gekumen mit mir

322
00:14:57,930 --> 00:15:00,185
fun Estraykh keyn ITALY

323
00:15:00,327 --> 00:15:03,088
un er hot gevoynt in Italye oykh finef yor mit mir.

324
00:15:03,297 --> 00:15:07,830
un fun ITALY iz er avekgeforn keyn Argentine. er hot gehat dort m- mishpokhe.

325
00:15:09,861 --> 00:15:13,685
hostu gezen vi nokh me nemt avek dayn vayb mit ir familye?

326
00:15:12,730 --> 00:15:13,669
NO.

327
00:15:13,810 --> 00:15:16,200
undz ze'mir geven in di vagonen farmakht.

328
00:15:17,539 --> 00:15:20,604
nokh dem, vos hot pasirt? vu bistu geganen?

329
00:15:24,070 --> 00:15:26,173
undz ze'mir durkhgeforn MAIDANEK

330
00:15:26,652 --> 00:15:30,308
un fun MAIDANEK hot men undz arayngefirt keyn, keyn BLIZYN.

331
00:15:31,174 --> 00:15:34,560
vi nokh hostu gevust az du forst adurkh MAIDANEK?

332
00:15:35,595 --> 00:15:37,513
hostu gekent zen epes?

333
00:15:36,017 --> 00:15:38,812
d- di mentshn tsvishn zikh hot men geredt.

334
00:15:40,017 --> 00:15:42,120
m'hot gevust alts vos hot pasirt.

335
00:15:45,096 --> 00:15:48,347
fun vos hostu geredt in di vagonen? vos hobn mentshn gezogt?

336
00:15:48,370 --> 00:15:50,586
gornisht. m'hot nisht gekent khapn keyn luft.

337
00:15:50,586 --> 00:15:51,621
m'hot geredt

338
00:15:52,926 --> 00:15:55,890
v- vu me fort, ven m'vet STOPn, ven m'vet

339
00:15:56,200 --> 00:15:58,894
vu m'vet geyn arbetn.

340
00:16:01,785 --> 00:16:05,854
vi lang hot gedoyert tsu forn fun TREBLINKA biz

341
00:16:05,854 --> 00:16:09,001
v- vu iz di ershte plats du bist gekumen? d-

342
00:16:08,805 --> 00:16:09,980
BLIZYN.

343
00:16:11,202 --> 00:16:12,850
BLIZYN oder PLASZOW.

344
00:16:17,344 --> 00:16:19,903
ven du bist aroys fun di vagonen

345
00:16:19,842 --> 00:16:23,565
m'hot undz aroysgenumen fun di vagonen, iz geven in, denk ikh in BLIZYN.

346
00:16:23,689 --> 00:16:25,843
iz geven der ershter lager.

347
00:16:26,001 --> 00:16:29,015
dos iz shoyn gevezn a arbets lager, nisht tsu farnikhtn.

348
00:16:30,979 --> 00:16:35,056
un gedenkst ven dos iz geven? velkhe, velkhe tsayt?

349
00:16:33,797 --> 00:16:35,124
dray un fertsik.

350
00:16:35,620 --> 00:16:37,369
bist arayn in BLIZYN?

351
00:16:37,459 --> 00:16:39,107
yo, dort hobn mir gearbet.

352
00:16:38,910 --> 00:16:44,574
un ven du bist ersht ar- arop fun di vagonen, vos hot pasirt? vos hobn zey gemakht mit dir?

353
00:16:41,188 --> 00:16:42,565
fun di vagonen

354
00:16:44,901 --> 00:16:48,067
arayngeshikt in lager, un gehat

355
00:16:48,462 --> 00:16:50,987
di breter, hot men geshlofn oyf di pritshes

356
00:16:51,077 --> 00:16:55,526
in barakn. do ⟨hot⟩ shoyn geven tsugegreyt der lager, mit barakn mit

357
00:16:55,617 --> 00:16:57,821
mit a vakh. altsding iz dort geven.

358
00:16:57,895 --> 00:17:02,411
hostu gemuzt nemen a tush ober epes a SHOWER?

359
00:17:02,822 --> 00:17:04,841
NO, m'hot undz gegebn a

360
00:17:05,050 --> 00:17:08,430
a militerishe, a MENAZKA vos, tsu

361
00:17:08,430 --> 00:17:09,990
tsu nemen esn in dem.

362
00:17:09,990 --> 00:17:12,181
dos hobn zey undz gegebn, un THAT'S ALL.

363
00:17:12,171 --> 00:17:16,130
ver iz geven dortn? ver hot dikh bavakht ven du bist arayngekumen?

364
00:17:16,406 --> 00:17:17,559
in lager?

365
00:17:17,559 --> 00:17:19,353
iz geven

366
00:17:20,473 --> 00:17:23,724
LIKE A PATROL, EH GERMAN PATROL.

367
00:17:24,000 --> 00:17:26,930
AND THEY GAVE US THAT TIME, THE FIRST TIME

368
00:17:26,953 --> 00:17:29,765
EH THE CONCENTRATION CAMP THE UNIFORM.

369
00:17:29,434 --> 00:17:31,098
vi nokh hot dos oysgezen?

370
00:17:30,582 --> 00:17:31,650
WHITE

371
00:17:32,826 --> 00:17:34,068
WHITE AND BLUE

372
00:17:34,108 --> 00:17:35,806
STRIPES.

373
00:17:35,863 --> 00:17:38,726
di hitl AND THE JACKET AND THE PANTS.

374
00:17:38,952 --> 00:17:42,118
un WOODEN, WOODEN SHOES.

375
00:17:42,597 --> 00:17:43,749
iz

376
00:17:43,749 --> 00:17:46,168
az m'hot dos farloyrn, hot men gedorfn geyn naket

377
00:17:46,360 --> 00:17:48,575
ober emetser hot dos tsugeganvet.

378
00:17:48,575 --> 00:17:52,546
mit dem hot men gedorfn geyn tsu der arbet un shlofn mit dem un esn mit dem.

379
00:17:54,021 --> 00:18:00,343
zog mir, velekhe tsayt fun di yor iz dos geven? dos iz geven zumer tsayt ober vinter tsayt?

380
00:18:00,231 --> 00:18:02,351
vinter oykhet, shtendik.

381
00:18:01,210 --> 00:18:04,275
NO, ven du bist arayngekumen in lager di ershte molt.

382
00:18:06,171 --> 00:18:08,797
LIKE YOU KNOW, SEPTEMBER, OCTOBER.

383
00:18:10,980 --> 00:18:12,526
zog mir fun di barakn.

384
00:18:13,005 --> 00:18:16,627
mit vemen bistu geven in di barakn? vi nokh hot dos oysgezen?

385
00:18:17,764 --> 00:18:20,317
iz geven a barakn firer

386
00:18:20,317 --> 00:18:21,757
iz gevezn a yid

387
00:18:21,814 --> 00:18:24,238
vos er hot t- tsuzamengeteylt di esn

388
00:18:24,868 --> 00:18:28,473
un m'hot undz aroysgefirt tsu der arbet in der fri.

389
00:18:28,716 --> 00:18:31,244
zeks in di fri flegt men undz oyfvekn

390
00:18:31,244 --> 00:18:32,557
un makhn apel

391
00:18:33,154 --> 00:18:35,392
oyfn plats dort un tseyln

392
00:18:35,449 --> 00:18:37,012
az s'felt nisht keyner.

393
00:18:37,120 --> 00:18:40,269
az eyner hot gefelt ⟨un⟩ kenst shteyn dort a ⟨gantser⟩ tog.

394
00:18:40,292 --> 00:18:41,788
m'hot gemuzt hobn ale.

395
00:18:42,199 --> 00:18:45,804
ikh hob zikh eyn mol farbahaltn unter a barak. kh'hob nisht gevolt geyn tsu der arbet

396
00:18:46,232 --> 00:18:48,673
iz di mentshn zenen geshtanen zeks sho.

397
00:18:49,067 --> 00:18:51,896
⟨iz⟩ zey hobn gehat GERMAN SHEPHERDS, hot er mir gefunen.

398
00:18:51,970 --> 00:18:54,917
vos zhe hobn zey getun mit mir? hot men mir gegebn tsen shmits

399
00:18:55,108 --> 00:18:56,756
o- on di hoyzn.

400
00:18:57,420 --> 00:18:59,911
ikh hob gedorfn tseyln fun eyns biz tsen.

401
00:19:00,390 --> 00:19:02,729
s'iz gevezn

402
00:19:02,888 --> 00:19:05,160
di RU- di RUBBER PIPES.

403
00:19:05,638 --> 00:19:08,585
un INSIDE iz gevezn COPPER tsu zayn shver.

404
00:19:08,625 --> 00:19:10,897
yeder zets ikh hob gedorfn tseyln

405
00:19:11,089 --> 00:19:13,985
un nakher hot ⟨mir nokh⟩ tsugeshtelt un gegan tsu der arbet.

406
00:19:14,734 --> 00:19:15,470
yo

407
00:19:15,139 --> 00:19:18,778
ver hot dir gegebn di shmits? ver hot dir geshlogn?

408
00:19:17,856 --> 00:19:22,423
nor ts- tsvey daytshn. eyner hot mir gehaltn bay di fis un eyner bay dem kop.

409
00:19:25,298 --> 00:19:28,093
vos far a arbet hostu gemakht dort in BLIZYN?

410
00:19:28,740 --> 00:19:29,848
OVER THERE

411
00:19:33,955 --> 00:19:34,826
nu

412
00:19:37,144 --> 00:19:39,959
d- dos paputshes UNK gemakht

413
00:19:39,959 --> 00:19:41,913
shtek shikh far di froyen

414
00:19:42,291 --> 00:19:44,242
mit GLUE

415
00:19:44,856 --> 00:19:45,980
un di GLUE

416
00:19:46,257 --> 00:19:49,122
hot geshtunken. m'hot nisht gekent khapn dem otem.

417
00:19:49,122 --> 00:19:50,722
aza shtarke kley.

418
00:19:51,184 --> 00:19:52,764
dos hot men gearbet dort.

419
00:19:53,766 --> 00:19:55,650
vi lang bistu dort gevezn?

420
00:19:56,938 --> 00:19:59,412
oykh nisht lang. a por monat.

421
00:19:59,605 --> 00:20:01,506
fun dort undz arayngeshikt

422
00:20:01,917 --> 00:20:03,143
keyn PLASZOW.

423
00:20:03,283 --> 00:20:05,912
far dem, ven du bist nokh geven in BLIZYN

424
00:20:05,912 --> 00:20:08,525
vos far a esn hobn zey dir gegebn?

425
00:20:09,713 --> 00:20:13,605
in der fri, eyder m'iz geganen tsu der arbet, hot men gegebn shvartse kave

426
00:20:14,100 --> 00:20:17,505
on tsuker on gornisht, un tey iz gevezn vaser

427
00:20:17,505 --> 00:20:18,734
heyse vaser.

428
00:20:19,062 --> 00:20:21,806
un az m'iz gegan tsu der arbet, ⟨ALL⟩ tsayt

429
00:20:23,260 --> 00:20:25,738
iz gevezn gedenk tsvelef a zeyger

430
00:20:26,284 --> 00:20:29,045
flegt men undz gebn a, a LITTLE BIT SOUP

431
00:20:29,794 --> 00:20:30,868
AND THAT'S ALL.

432
00:20:32,123 --> 00:20:35,357
bistu geven mit a bakanter emetser, ober

433
00:20:34,823 --> 00:20:38,192
ale zenen geven bakant dort, mit vemen ⟨hobn mir⟩ geredt dort

434
00:20:38,400 --> 00:20:40,202
geven fun farshidene shtet

435
00:20:40,202 --> 00:20:41,465
farshidene yidn.

436
00:20:42,282 --> 00:20:45,651
fun vanet zenen di yidn gevezn? fun velkhe pletser?

437
00:20:45,252 --> 00:20:47,608
fun ale shtet. fun Lodzh oykhet

438
00:20:47,884 --> 00:20:48,705
yo.

439
00:20:50,044 --> 00:20:52,097
oder in andere lagern

440
00:20:52,558 --> 00:20:56,838
in Estraykh iz shoyn gevezn andere EUROPeishe

441
00:20:56,895 --> 00:20:58,188
COUNTRIES yidn

442
00:20:58,212 --> 00:20:59,556
fun Ungarn

443
00:21:00,034 --> 00:21:03,015
fun BELGIUM, fun Frankraykh, Holand.

444
00:21:03,443 --> 00:21:05,614
un in BLIZYN

445
00:21:06,058 --> 00:21:06,932
v-

446
00:21:06,932 --> 00:21:11,064
zog mir fun di kapos. vi hobn zey, yo

447
00:21:09,653 --> 00:21:11,385
di kapos hobn geshlogn.

448
00:21:12,910 --> 00:21:16,245
zenen zey ale geven yidn, ober s'iz geven polyakn oykhet?

449
00:21:15,458 --> 00:21:16,245
NO

450
00:21:16,656 --> 00:21:20,278
a kapo hot nisht gekent zayn keyn yid. bloyz a barak firer iz geven a yid.

451
00:21:20,773 --> 00:21:21,492
yo

452
00:21:21,735 --> 00:21:24,361
un bay dir, ver iz geven der kapo? gedenkst?

453
00:21:26,292 --> 00:21:28,294
eyner iz geven fun Kroke

454
00:21:28,435 --> 00:21:30,707
vi nokh hot er geheysn? KUDLER

455
00:21:31,084 --> 00:21:32,175
a krokever

456
00:21:32,738 --> 00:21:36,124
un az di amerikaner zenen arayngekumen

457
00:21:36,518 --> 00:21:38,638
in finef un ⟨fertsntn⟩ yor

458
00:21:38,762 --> 00:21:42,468
iz hot er gevust er hot getun shlekht far di yidn, un er iz geven oykhet a yid

459
00:21:42,643 --> 00:21:44,459
hot er zikh tsugeshtelt

460
00:21:44,668 --> 00:21:46,282
tsu di amerikaner armey

461
00:21:47,385 --> 00:21:48,577
frayvilik

462
00:21:48,786 --> 00:21:52,205
TO dinen in der armey. m'hot im aroysge⟨numen⟩ fun dort.

463
00:21:52,667 --> 00:21:57,077
un dos iz geven shpeter, yo? ober far dem

464
00:21:53,865 --> 00:21:55,867
ye, KUDLER, nokh der bafrayung.

465
00:21:58,725 --> 00:22:05,013
in di arbet in BLIZYN, vu hostu gearbet? hostu gearbet in di lager ober d'host gemuzt aroysgeyn?

466
00:22:06,319 --> 00:22:12,405
in lager hot men gemakht shtek shikh, di hiltserne shikh, un, un droysn fun lager flegt men arbetn

467
00:22:12,428 --> 00:22:15,487
oyf di shoseyen, oyf di vegn, oysarbetn

468
00:22:15,487 --> 00:22:18,496
az di militerishe mashinen kenen durkhforn.

469
00:22:18,469 --> 00:22:20,994
hostu dos oykhet gemakht?

470
00:22:19,431 --> 00:22:21,045
dos oykhet gearbet, yo.

471
00:22:22,789 --> 00:22:25,346
un di militer iz, flegn farbaygeyn

472
00:22:25,346 --> 00:22:28,510
marshirn, flegn zey zogn "di yidn zenen shuldik in di krig."

473
00:22:28,510 --> 00:22:30,342
varfn shteyner.

474
00:22:31,817 --> 00:22:34,663
hostu gesh- hostu geshprokhn daytsh oykhet?

475
00:22:35,125 --> 00:22:39,523
az m'iz gevezn dort, hot men ge- gelernt zikh a bisl daytshn tsu farshteyn.

476
00:22:40,120 --> 00:22:42,274
m'hot geredt dort farshidene shprakhn.

477
00:22:44,187 --> 00:22:47,339
un ven du bist aroys fun BLIZYN

478
00:22:47,339 --> 00:22:49,969
vi nokh bistu aroys, un vu bistu geganen?

479
00:22:49,367 --> 00:22:50,964
mit di

480
00:22:51,207 --> 00:22:53,110
mit PASSAZHIRSKIE banen.

481
00:22:53,110 --> 00:22:54,677
m'hot tsugeshtelt banen.

482
00:22:54,868 --> 00:22:58,169
vi nokh bistu gevorn selektirt aroystsuforn?

483
00:22:58,362 --> 00:23:00,803
ikh hob nisht SELECTED. zey hobn SELECTED.

484
00:23:00,471 --> 00:23:02,068
ver hot SELECTED?

485
00:23:01,450 --> 00:23:03,919
di daytshn. ver hot SELECTED? zey.

486
00:23:03,919 --> 00:23:06,354
zey hobn detsidirt vu tsu nemen undz.

487
00:23:06,411 --> 00:23:09,982
vu m'hot gedorfn mentshn tsu der arbet, vu m'hot gedorfn dort

488
00:23:06,530 --> 00:23:07,366
bay

489
00:23:10,022 --> 00:23:11,332
zey hobn SELECTED.

490
00:23:10,073 --> 00:23:11,141
far

491
00:23:11,141 --> 00:23:14,685
far vos meynstu az du bist selektirt aroystsugeyn?

492
00:23:14,685 --> 00:23:17,812
far vos meynstu az zey hobn z- dikh selektirt aroystsuforn?

493
00:23:17,920 --> 00:23:22,510
zey hobn getoysht di lagern, vayl s'i- ven s'iz shoyn geven ven di rusn flegn

494
00:23:22,510 --> 00:23:25,625
atakirn Daytshland un Amerike iz arayn in di milkhome

495
00:23:25,625 --> 00:23:27,819
iz hobn zey geTRIED di lagern

496
00:23:27,876 --> 00:23:29,574
fun Poyln

497
00:23:29,783 --> 00:23:36,040
tsu shtupn tsurik in Estraykh un Daytshland, vayter, vayter nenter tsu Daytshland, zey zoln nisht araynfaln keyn

498
00:23:36,040 --> 00:23:37,168
tsu di rusn.

499
00:23:37,377 --> 00:23:40,644
a FACT az s'iz gevezn in Tshenstekhover lager

500
00:23:40,836 --> 00:23:43,496
UNK zey ganen b- nakht shikh tsu di arbet

501
00:23:43,620 --> 00:23:47,444
un in di fri zenen zey ⟨umgekumen⟩ mit di rusishe armey, bafrayt shoyn.

502
00:23:47,805 --> 00:23:49,166
iz geven a nes.

503
00:23:49,830 --> 00:23:52,372
SO fun BLIZYN vu bistu geganen?

504
00:23:52,294 --> 00:23:53,486
keyn PLASZOW.

505
00:23:53,391 --> 00:23:54,988
ven iz dos gevezn?

506
00:23:55,298 --> 00:23:56,473
ikh denk

507
00:23:56,631 --> 00:23:58,447
di ende OF dray un fertsik

508
00:23:58,487 --> 00:24:00,033
un fir un fertsik.

509
00:24:00,934 --> 00:24:03,813
vi lang hot gedoyert fun BLIZYN nokh PLASZOW?

510
00:24:04,680 --> 00:24:07,239
UNK biz Kroke, bay tsen sho.

511
00:24:08,038 --> 00:24:09,297
un

512
00:24:09,388 --> 00:24:11,862
iz dos geven oykhet di vagonen?

513
00:24:11,532 --> 00:24:14,749
in va- NO, dos iz shoyn geven in PASSAZHIRSKIE banen.

514
00:24:14,755 --> 00:24:16,419
zey hobn nisht gehat keyn vagonen.

515
00:24:16,510 --> 00:24:20,132
di vagonen iz geven BUSY tsu brengen tsu di GAS CHAMBERS.

516
00:24:20,138 --> 00:24:21,684
farmakhte vagonen.

517
00:24:22,264 --> 00:24:25,008
undz hobn zey shoyn gefirt in rikhtike banen.

518
00:24:26,483 --> 00:24:30,290
ven du bist arayngekumen in PLASZOW, vos hostu gezen? vos hot pasirt?

519
00:24:29,537 --> 00:24:31,725
gornisht. m'hot undz gegebn a numer

520
00:24:31,748 --> 00:24:34,779
oyfgehongen in do un a numer IN THE BACK

521
00:24:34,785 --> 00:24:36,314
a gele late, nu

522
00:24:36,608 --> 00:24:38,441
un dos iz geven mayn numer.

523
00:24:38,565 --> 00:24:40,292
damolst hob ikh nisht gehat a

524
00:24:40,292 --> 00:24:43,419
finef akhtsik toyznt, an ander numer, akht un fertsik.

525
00:24:45,467 --> 00:24:49,511
un m'iz arayngan. yeder eyner hot gehat zayn, a pritshe vu tsu shlofn

526
00:24:49,517 --> 00:24:50,793
in di barakn.

527
00:24:52,420 --> 00:24:54,844
vi hot oysgezen di lager in PLASZOW?

528
00:24:56,503 --> 00:24:59,445
s'iz geven di CREMATORIUM. s'iz geven di KITCHEN

529
00:24:59,445 --> 00:25:02,904
⟨in derin⟩. zey hobn geshtanen a gants tog in lager

530
00:25:02,904 --> 00:25:05,525
un di resht flegn aroysgeyn tsu di arbet

531
00:25:05,835 --> 00:25:08,478
mit grupn, mit di, mit a vakh.

532
00:25:09,514 --> 00:25:11,162
mit vem hostu gearbet?

533
00:25:11,860 --> 00:25:12,951
mit vemen?

534
00:25:13,665 --> 00:25:15,177
vos heyst mit vemen?

535
00:25:14,374 --> 00:25:17,203
vos far, vos far a mentshn hostu gearbet ⟨in⟩

536
00:25:17,158 --> 00:25:18,687
kh'hob geven

537
00:25:18,897 --> 00:25:23,751
l- s'iz gevezn f- holender un fun Frankraykh, Ungarn

538
00:25:23,942 --> 00:25:24,813
ale.

539
00:25:25,005 --> 00:25:28,964
di foyle mentshn iz gevezn di holender. zey hobn nisht gevolt arbetn.

540
00:25:29,275 --> 00:25:30,537
hoykhe mentshn.

541
00:25:30,537 --> 00:25:33,043
iz vos zey flegn tun di sh- di daytshn?

542
00:25:33,043 --> 00:25:36,493
mit a SHOVEL, mit a biks, gebn a zets ibern kop

543
00:25:36,493 --> 00:25:37,978
zenen geven shuldik

544
00:25:37,978 --> 00:25:39,359
nisht gevolt arbetn.

545
00:25:39,636 --> 00:25:42,783
ikh hob nor gekukt, ikh zol nisht krign geshlogn

546
00:25:42,783 --> 00:25:44,734
ikh zol tun di arbet vos ikh darf tun.

547
00:25:46,082 --> 00:25:48,523
un vos far a arbet hostu gemakht in PLASZOW?

548
00:25:49,474 --> 00:25:51,948
in PLASZOW hot men undz aroysgenumen

549
00:25:52,309 --> 00:25:55,492
oykhet oyf di, oyf di vegn. oysglaykhn di vegn.

550
00:25:57,557 --> 00:26:00,014
vi lang hostu geflegt arbetn in a tog?

551
00:26:00,223 --> 00:26:01,331
in droysn

552
00:26:01,793 --> 00:26:04,099
denk ikh biz s'iz gevorn tunkl.

553
00:26:04,830 --> 00:26:06,494
nisht geven keyn ⟨akht⟩ sho.

554
00:26:07,193 --> 00:26:08,773
biz s'iz gevorn fintster.

555
00:26:09,150 --> 00:26:11,607
UNK flegn mir marshirn tsurik in lager.

556
00:26:12,323 --> 00:26:15,742
un vos, vos far a esn hobn zey gegebn dortn?

557
00:26:16,322 --> 00:26:19,421
bay nakht flegt men undz gebn broyt.

558
00:26:19,630 --> 00:26:23,100
di broyt iz geven fun CZECHOSLOVAKIA

559
00:26:23,427 --> 00:26:27,133
un eyn mol a monat CIGARETTES. finef tsigaretn a monat.

560
00:26:27,173 --> 00:26:29,158
UNK ⟨ZORR⟩ hot geheysn di tsigaret.

561
00:26:29,265 --> 00:26:32,038
iz ver es hot geven a shtarker roykher

562
00:26:32,038 --> 00:26:33,530
hot er farkoyft far broyt.

563
00:26:33,530 --> 00:26:35,923
ikh hob nisht geroykhert, hob ikh getoysht mit di broyt.

564
00:26:36,437 --> 00:26:38,206
oder in la-

565
00:26:38,206 --> 00:26:40,565
iz flegt men undz gebn di broyt bay nakht

566
00:26:40,723 --> 00:26:43,771
un az nisht, az ⟨host⟩ nisht gehaltn gut

567
00:26:43,795 --> 00:26:48,261
oder s'iz nisht glaykh oyfgegesn, hot men dir aroysgerisn fun hant, un ⟨zey⟩ hobn es tsugenumen.

568
00:26:48,469 --> 00:26:51,298
un, SOUP, SOUP flegt zayn

569
00:26:51,372 --> 00:26:53,424
fun alte broyt

570
00:26:53,498 --> 00:26:58,959
hot men es arayngenumen in a, in a groysn kesl mit vareme vaser, hot men es ongevaremt.

571
00:26:59,067 --> 00:27:00,630
dos iz geven di SOUP.

572
00:27:00,636 --> 00:27:03,313
oder kapuste oder brukves.

573
00:27:04,095 --> 00:27:06,266
vos m'hot gegebn iz geven gut.

574
00:27:07,555 --> 00:27:13,438
un zog mir, az d'host zikh gevolt vashn ober opreynikn, hostu gegat plats?

575
00:27:13,157 --> 00:27:13,927
NO.

576
00:27:13,950 --> 00:27:15,564
NO- nisht in barak.

577
00:27:16,178 --> 00:27:19,108
zuntik, eyn mol a d- a vokh

578
00:27:19,266 --> 00:27:23,259
iz gevezn a, aza kleyne budke mit a SHOWER

579
00:27:23,670 --> 00:27:26,532
iz hot men ⟨dir⟩ gegebn oder eyn minut oder tsvey minut.

580
00:27:26,860 --> 00:27:32,153
to vos hot ir getun? anshtot vashn dir, hostu ⟨gedank got⟩ hostu gekhapt di vaser in moyl arayn tsu trinken

581
00:27:32,243 --> 00:27:35,679
vos ge- gehat genug vaser tsu trinken, host aroysgelofn.

582
00:27:36,057 --> 00:27:38,379
hot men gedorfn loyfn naket fun barak

583
00:27:38,638 --> 00:27:41,214
in di budke tsu nemen di SHOWER

584
00:27:41,372 --> 00:27:42,345
zuntik.

585
00:27:42,351 --> 00:27:44,862
un den di ontuekhts ⟨hobn mir⟩ gehat

586
00:27:44,862 --> 00:27:47,272
hot men gedorfn ayntunken in a

587
00:27:47,329 --> 00:27:49,786
in a FLUORIC, in a ACID.

588
00:27:49,827 --> 00:27:51,609
az di layz zoln nisht kumen.

589
00:27:51,649 --> 00:27:54,911
iz hot es gebrent oyf di SKIN, un m'hot dos gemuzt makhn.

590
00:27:54,911 --> 00:27:58,800
eyner iz geshtanen, im, m'iz farbaygeganen un ayntunken, aroysnemen.

591
00:27:58,800 --> 00:28:00,586
un ontun tsurik oyf zikh

592
00:28:01,639 --> 00:28:02,797
naserheyt.

593
00:28:04,255 --> 00:28:06,847
ver di bavakht di lager in PLASZOW?

594
00:28:07,157 --> 00:28:09,761
dos iz geven daytshn ober ukrayner?

595
00:28:09,761 --> 00:28:10,965
ver iz dos geven?

596
00:28:10,279 --> 00:28:15,094
NO, di ukrayner iz bloyz geven, zey hobn gefirt di transportn tsu di GAS CHAMBERS

597
00:28:15,094 --> 00:28:16,686
mit shvartse mundirn

598
00:28:17,383 --> 00:28:19,891
un ⟨di⟩ lager hobn shtendik bavakht daytshn

599
00:28:20,691 --> 00:28:21,917
der WEHRMACHT

600
00:28:22,041 --> 00:28:23,469
nisht di S.S.

601
00:28:23,627 --> 00:28:26,827
in PLASZOW hostu gezen a mol di lager firer?

602
00:28:27,120 --> 00:28:29,713
yo. PLASZOW iz geven a groyser lager.

603
00:28:30,141 --> 00:28:30,860
yo.

604
00:28:30,745 --> 00:28:33,358
gedenkst di lager firer fun PLASZOW?

605
00:28:33,752 --> 00:28:34,623
NO.

606
00:28:36,840 --> 00:28:37,559
NO.

607
00:28:37,431 --> 00:28:38,938
hot geflegt tsu

608
00:28:38,938 --> 00:28:42,925
tsu raytn oyf a vaysn ferd. hostu im gezen a molt?

609
00:28:42,747 --> 00:28:43,905
in PLASZOW?

610
00:28:44,029 --> 00:28:44,900
NO.

611
00:28:46,122 --> 00:28:47,499
nisht gehert dos.

612
00:28:47,505 --> 00:28:49,693
mit hint, mit groyse hint?

613
00:28:49,024 --> 00:28:51,139
di hent, ye, GERMAN SHEPHERDS.

614
00:28:51,139 --> 00:28:52,768
zenen shtendik gegan ⟨oyf⟩ di hint.

615
00:28:54,407 --> 00:28:57,846
OKAY. m'vet oyfhern yetst, un m'vet vekslen di TAPES.

